        "# Logistics ML Model: Predict Late Deliveries\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook covers the development, evaluation, and explanation of a Machine Learning pipeline designed to predict late shipments for a fictional cold-chain distributor in Delhi.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Project Steps:\n",
        "1. **Setup & Data Loading**: Install packages and load shipment records.\n",
        "2. **EDA & Data Cleaning**: Handle mismatched timezones, out-of-order scan events, and renamed hubs.\n",
        "3. **Feature Engineering**: Create robust features for predicting delays.\n",
        "4. **Model Pipeline**: Build a scikit-learn pipeline (imputation, encoding, scaling).\n",
        "5. **Model Training & Selection**: Train Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and LightGBM/XGBoost.\n",
        "6. **Threshold Optimization**: Apply a business-driven cost matrix.\n",
        "7. **Model Explanation**: Use SHAP for global and individual interpretations.\n",
        "8. **Export**: Save the pipeline for deployment with FastAPI."
      ]
    },
