        "## Part 4 & 5: Preprocessing Pipeline and Initial Model Training\n",
        "Let's construct a scikit-learn preprocessing pipeline and evaluate 4 different models:\n",
        "- **Logistic Regression**\n",
        "- **Random Forest**\n",
        "- **XGBoost**\n",
        "- **LightGBM**\n",
        "\n",
        "We will handle categorical features (including high-cardinality routes) and numerical features cleanly."
